        "HowToBuildDescription": "To build your burger, start by selecting your desired ingredients from the list provided. Choose from a variety of options including fresh vegetables like lettuce, tomatoes, and onions, as well as cheeses, sauces, and premium toppings like avocado or bacon. Customize your burger to your liking by adding or removing ingredients as you go.",
